      "body": "**Moderation** — `ban` `unban` `kick` `timeout` `untimeout` `warn` `warnings` `clearwarns` `softban` `cases` `purge` `lock` `unlock` `slowmode`\n**Setup** — `setup` `prefix` `language` `panel` `dashboard` `automod`\n**Info** — `serverinfo` `userinfo` `avatar` `ping`\n**Community** — `rank` `leaderboard` `ticket` `suggest` `poll` `giveaway`\n**Webhooks** — `webhook` (create · list · send · compose · embed)\n**Games** — `xo` `memory` `rps` `slots` `c4` `blackjack` `mines` `hangman` `hl` `trivia` `lights` `2048` `reaction` `wordle` `guess` `dice`\n**Music** — `play` `pause` `skip` `stop` `loop` `shuffle` `volume` `remove` `move` `queue` `np`\n**Instances** — `instance`\n\nSlash: `/help` · Prefix: `{prefix}help`",
